    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the world of EleBall Circus and its brightest star\u2014Eddie the Elephant!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EleBall</strong> is a fun, easy-to-pick-up arcade adventure about Eddie\u2014a circus elephant who tries their best to catch falling objects while simultaneously keeping their balance on a bouncy ball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/1c3f69dc7dfb19dc0e47ee460d50b4dc.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance while holding falling objects and watching out for hazards. Score big and the crowds will love you! Adjust to the situation in order to survive in the harsh world of the circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/95df7a51153e2dbdb26585eeae28e404.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you work, the more money you earn. You can use it to buy new outfits and balls for Eddie. With over 80 unique items, pick your favorites to really create your dream EleBaller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/a7c8c31e180835dd980cd59728192fb5.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of playing against a timer? Do you want to just take it easy, or get weird with different modifiers? Then check out the Freeplay mode, where you can pick any level background and music along with modifiers to suit your experience. Want to start your own Elephant Space Program? We've got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/ca33205dfd75024290f9ef4ca1792466.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling through the game, you'll uncover bits and pieces of the secret that lies behind EleBall Circus. Can you balance your way out of this mysterious tale? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the world of EleBall Circus and its brightest star\u2014Eddie the Elephant!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EleBall</strong> is a fun, easy-to-pick-up arcade adventure about Eddie\u2014a circus elephant who tries their best to catch falling objects while simultaneously keeping their balance on a bouncy ball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/1c3f69dc7dfb19dc0e47ee460d50b4dc.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance while holding falling objects and watching out for hazards. Score big and the crowds will love you! Adjust to the situation in order to survive in the harsh world of the circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/7564745eb11eb41a6f3759f69cec6b8e.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/95df7a51153e2dbdb26585eeae28e404.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you work, the more money you earn. You can use it to buy new outfits and balls for Eddie. With over 80 unique items, pick your favorites to really create your dream EleBaller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/285e6d1db170bc3490736dc74bb1ec66.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/a7c8c31e180835dd980cd59728192fb5.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of playing against a timer? Do you want to just take it easy, or get weird with different modifiers? Then check out the Freeplay mode, where you can pick any level background and music along with modifiers to suit your experience. Want to start your own Elephant Space Program? We've got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/8cdf320d19f1b032dce7cdbd5e33157c.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/ca33205dfd75024290f9ef4ca1792466.avif?t=1752468726\" width=615 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling through the game, you'll uncover bits and pieces of the secret that lies behind EleBall Circus. Can you balance your way out of this mysterious tale? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.poster.avif?t=1752468726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.webm?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985890/extras/f9210f2305b5705c146b2b00265bf987.mp4?t=1752468726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
